From {{inh|is|non|vinna}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*winnaną}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*wenh₁-||to strive, wish, desire, love}}. Related to {{cog|fo|vinna}}, {{cog|sv|vinna}}, {{cog|nb|vinne}}, {{cog|en|win}}, {{cog|nl|winnen}}, and {{cog|de|gewinnen}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|vann|unnu|unnið}}

